#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1262
msgid "Apple Driver mode can see the device again. ZenLink Studio stops until its driver is installed again. A backup is saved first. Windows will ask for administrator permission. Unplug and reconnect the cable afterwards."
msgstr "Mode Apple Driver bisa melihat perangkat lagi. ZenLink Studio berhenti sampai drivernya dipasang lagi. Cadangan disimpan dulu. Windows akan minta izin administrator. Cabut lalu colok lagi kabelnya setelah selesai."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1265
msgid "Install the ZenLink Studio driver?"
msgstr "Pasang driver ZenLink Studio?"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1266
msgid "Like TikTok LIVE Studio, ZenLink installs the libusb-win32 driver for this device. While it is installed, Apple mode and Apple apps can't see the device; press Restore Apple driver to switch back. If there is no driver package for this model yet, ZenLink builds one and signs it with a new certificate named \"ZenLink ZenLink Studio\", added to Windows' trusted certificates (its private key is deleted). A backup is saved first, and Apple's driver comes back automatically if the device doesn't start. Windows will ask for administrator permission. Unplug and reconnect the cable afterwards."
msgstr "Seperti TikTok LIVE Studio, ZenLink memasang driver libusb-win32 untuk perangkat ini. Selama terpasang, mode Apple dan aplikasi Apple tidak melihat perangkat; tekan Kembalikan driver Apple untuk balik. Kalau belum ada paket driver untuk model ini, ZenLink membuatnya dan menandatanganinya dengan sertifikat baru bernama \"ZenLink ZenLink Studio\" yang ditambahkan ke sertifikat tepercaya Windows (kunci privatnya dihapus). Cadangan disimpan dulu, dan driver Apple dipasang lagi otomatis kalau perangkat gagal jalan. Windows akan minta izin administrator. Cabut lalu colok lagi kabelnya setelah selesai."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1269
msgid "Remove the libusb0 filter?"
msgstr "Hapus filter libusb0?"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:1270
msgid "It is stacked on Apple's driver, which can crash Windows. Apple's driver stays. A backup is saved first. Windows will ask for administrator permission."
msgstr "Filter ini menumpuk di driver Apple dan bisa membuat Windows crash. Driver Apple tetap ada. Cadangan disimpan dulu. Windows akan minta izin administrator."

