msgstr "Menunggu HP memindai…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2494
msgid "The QR code was not scanned within 2 minutes. Try again, or use a pairing code"
msgstr "QR tidak dipindai dalam 2 menit. Coba lagi, atau pakai kode pairing"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2497
msgid "Phone found, pairing…"
msgstr "HP ditemukan, pairing…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2503
msgid "Paired, connecting…"
msgstr "Pairing berhasil, menyambung…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2517
msgid "Connect failed"
msgstr "Sambung gagal"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2526
msgid "Paired. Enter the address on the Wireless debugging screen and press Connect"
msgstr "Pairing berhasil. Isi alamat di layar Wireless debugging lalu tekan Sambung"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2578
msgid "Test recording"
msgstr "Rekaman uji"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2606
msgid "The picked device is not ready yet. Follow the steps below, then press Start."
msgstr "Perangkat yang dipilih belum siap. Ikuti langkah di bawah, lalu tekan Mulai."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2610
msgid "Pick a device first. Plug in the phone with USB debugging on, or connect it over Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Pilih perangkat dulu. Colok HP dengan Debugging USB aktif, atau sambungkan lewat Wi-Fi."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2620
msgid "The scrcpy server file is missing ({e}). Reinstall ZenLink."
msgstr "File server scrcpy tidak ada ({e}). Pasang ulang ZenLink."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2713
msgid "Needs attention"
msgstr "Perlu izin"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2857
msgid "Pick a ready Android phone first."
msgstr "Pilih HP Android yang siap dulu."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2897
msgid "The window did not open: {e}"
msgstr "Jendela gagal dibuka: {e}"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2997
msgid "Mirroring failed: {_0}. Reconnect the cable or tap Allow on the phone, then Start again."
msgstr "Mirroring gagal: {_0}. Cabut-colok kabel atau ketuk Izinkan di HP, lalu Mulai lagi."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:2998
msgid "Retrying… ({_0})"
msgstr "Mencoba lagi… ({_0})"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3025
msgid "Turn on mouse control on this phone"
msgstr "Aktifkan kontrol mouse di HP ini"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3026
msgid "Xiaomi, Redmi and POCO phones (MIUI / HyperOS) ignore the mouse and keyboard until you allow it: on the phone open Settings › Additional settings › Developer options and turn on \"USB debugging (Security settings)\" (it may ask for a Mi account and a SIM card). Then press Stop and Start again."
msgstr "HP Xiaomi, Redmi dan POCO (MIUI / HyperOS) mengabaikan mouse dan keyboard sampai kamu izinkan: di HP buka Setelan › Setelan tambahan › Opsi pengembang lalu aktifkan \"USB debugging (Security settings)\" / \"Debug USB (Setelan keamanan)\" (bisa minta akun Mi dan kartu SIM). Lalu tekan Stop dan Start lagi."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3027
msgid "Open Developer options on the phone"
msgstr "Buka Opsi pengembang di HP"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3048
msgid "Ghost mode off"
msgstr "Mode Ghost mati"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3062
msgid "Ghost mode: clicks go to the app behind. Press {key} again (or click the tray icon) to leave."
msgstr "Mode Ghost: klik tembus ke aplikasi di belakang. Tekan {key} lagi (atau klik ikon tray) untuk keluar."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3079
msgid "This shortcut needs Apple Driver mode while mirroring."
msgstr "Shortcut ini butuh mode Apple Driver saat mirroring."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3086
msgid "Sound on the PC: off (Alt+M)"
msgstr "Suara di PC: mati (Alt+M)"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3088
msgid "Sound on the PC: on (Alt+M)"
msgstr "Suara di PC: nyala (Alt+M)"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3105
msgid "Rotation: {label}"
msgstr "Rotasi: {label}"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3121
msgid "Copy history cleared. The next Alt+C starts fresh."
msgstr "Riwayat teks dihapus. Alt+C berikutnya mulai dari awal."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3130
msgid "Typing {n} characters on the device."
msgstr "Mengetik {n} karakter di perangkat."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3132
msgid "The PC clipboard has no text."
msgstr "Clipboard PC tidak berisi teks."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3170
msgid "The chosen encoder failed; now using {using}. Your choice is kept."
msgstr "Encoder pilihan gagal, sekarang pakai {using}. Pilihanmu tetap disimpan."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3181
msgid "Open ZenLink"
msgstr "Buka ZenLink"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3286
msgid "Checking for updates…"
msgstr "Memeriksa pembaruan…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3296
msgid "ZenLink is up to date."
msgstr "ZenLink sudah versi terbaru."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3307
msgid "Other edition: v{v}. Installs as a separate app; settings do not move over."
msgstr "Edisi lain: v{v}. Terpasang sebagai aplikasi terpisah, pengaturan tidak ikut pindah."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3309
msgid "New version available: v{v}"
msgstr "Versi baru tersedia: v{v}"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3316
msgid "ZenLink v{v} is available. Open Settings › Updates."
msgstr "ZenLink v{v} tersedia. Buka Pengaturan › Pembaruan."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3324
msgid "Could not check: {e}"
msgstr "Tidak bisa memeriksa: {e}"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3360
msgid "Failed: {e}"
msgstr "Gagal: {e}"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3366
msgid "Downloading {_0}…"
msgstr "Mengunduh {_0}…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3397
msgid "The other edition's installer is open."
msgstr "Penginstal edisi lain sudah dibuka."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3405
msgid "Update failed: {e}"
msgstr "Pembaruan gagal: {e}"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3574
msgid "Pick an iPhone or iPad first. Plug it in with the cable and unlock it; it shows up in the list."
msgstr "Pilih iPhone atau iPad dulu. Colok pakai kabel dan buka kuncinya; perangkat muncul di daftar."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3609
msgid "{name} is not connected. Plug in the cable (or join the same Wi-Fi), unlock it, then press Start."
msgstr "{name} belum tersambung. Colokkan kabel (atau sambungkan ke Wi-Fi yang sama), buka kunci, lalu tekan Mulai."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3631
msgid "Waiting for administrator permission…"
msgstr "Menunggu izin administrator…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3698
msgid "Restarting the ZenLink service…"
msgstr "Memulai ulang layanan ZenLink…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3716
msgid "Restarting the connection…"
msgstr "Memulai ulang koneksi…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3796
msgid "Applying the Android settings…"
msgstr "Menerapkan pengaturan Android…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:3987
msgid "Could not install adb. Check the internet connection and try again."
msgstr "Gagal memasang adb. Cek internet lalu coba lagi."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4287
msgid "The mode was not saved, try again."
msgstr "Mode belum tersimpan, coba lagi."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4308
msgid "Switching to Wi-Fi…"
msgstr "Beralih ke Wi-Fi…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4310
msgid "Switching to the cable…"
msgstr "Beralih ke kabel…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4324
msgid "The connection could not be changed, try again."
msgstr "Sambungan belum bisa diganti, coba lagi."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4414
msgid "Setting up Wi-Fi…"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Wi-Fi…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4416
msgid "Checking drivers…"
msgstr "Memeriksa driver…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4442
msgid "Wi-Fi is ready. You can unplug the cable."
msgstr "Wi-Fi siap. Sekarang bisa tanpa kabel."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4444
msgid "Wi-Fi could not be set up."
msgstr "Wi-Fi belum bisa disiapkan."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4451
msgid "Drivers checked."
msgstr "Driver sudah diperiksa."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4551
msgid "Nothing was copied on the phone."
msgstr "Tidak ada yang tersalin di HP."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4553
msgid "Copied from the phone. Paste it on the PC with Ctrl+V."
msgstr "Tersalin dari HP. Tempel di PC dengan Ctrl+V."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4555
msgid "Text copied on the phone, but Windows didn't allow it on the clipboard."
msgstr "Teks tersalin di HP, tapi Windows tidak mengizinkannya masuk clipboard."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4677
msgid "Unlocking the device…"
msgstr "Membuka kunci perangkat…"

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:4987
msgid "No picture from the iPhone/iPad yet. Unlock the device and press Restart. If it stays empty, send the logs (Settings › About › Open log folder)."
msgstr "Belum ada gambar dari iPhone/iPad. Buka kunci perangkat lalu tekan Mulai ulang. Kalau tetap kosong, kirim log (Pengaturan › Tentang › Buka folder log)."

#: apps/desktop/src/main.rs:5001
msgid "sound"
msgstr "suara"

#. added by hand
msgid "The device was disconnected. Plug it back in and try again."
msgstr "Perangkat terputus. Colok lagi, lalu coba lagi."

#. added by hand
msgid "Another app is using the device's screen (Xcode, QuickTime, TikTok LIVE Studio). Close it and try again."
msgstr "Aplikasi lain sedang memakai layar perangkat (Xcode, QuickTime, TikTok LIVE Studio). Tutup dulu, lalu coba lagi."

#. added by hand
msgid "Unlock the device and tap Trust, then try again."
msgstr "Buka kunci perangkat dan tekan Percayai (Trust), lalu coba lagi."

#. added by hand
msgid "Connect the device with the cable, unlock it and tap Trust first."
msgstr "Colokkan perangkat pakai kabel, buka kunci, lalu tekan Percayai (Trust) dulu."

#. added by hand
msgid "Wi-Fi is already set up."
msgstr "Wi-Fi sudah siap. Bisa tanpa kabel."

#. added by hand
msgid "Wi-Fi needs Apple Driver mode."
msgstr "Wi-Fi butuh mode Apple Driver."

#. added by hand
msgid "Stop casting first."
msgstr "Hentikan mirroring dulu."

#. added by hand
msgid "The iPhone or iPad is in a phone or video call. End the call, then try again."
msgstr "iPhone/iPad sedang dalam panggilan (telepon atau video call). Akhiri panggilan dulu, lalu coba lagi."

#. added by hand
msgid "Choose a connection mode first."
msgstr "Pilih mode koneksi dulu."

#. added by hand
msgid "Connect an iPhone or iPad with a USB cable."
msgstr "Colokkan iPhone atau iPad pakai kabel USB."

#. added by hand
msgid "This device uses the ZenLink Studio driver, so Apple mode can't see it. Press Restore Apple driver in Settings > Connection & Drivers, or switch to ZenLink Studio."
msgstr "Perangkat ini memakai driver ZenLink Studio, jadi mode Apple tidak bisa melihatnya. Tekan Kembalikan driver Apple di Pengaturan > Koneksi & driver, atau ganti ke ZenLink Studio."

#. added by hand
msgid "ZenLink Studio needs its driver on this device. Press Install ZenLink Studio driver in Settings > Connection & Drivers, or switch to Apple Driver mode."
msgstr "ZenLink Studio butuh drivernya di perangkat ini. Tekan Pasang driver ZenLink Studio di Pengaturan > Koneksi & driver, atau ganti ke mode Apple Driver."

#. added by hand
msgid "A libusb0 filter is stacked on Apple's driver. Press Remove libusb0 filter in Settings > Connection & Drivers first."
msgstr "Filter libusb0 menumpuk di driver Apple. Tekan Hapus filter libusb0 di Pengaturan > Koneksi & driver dulu."

#. added by hand
msgid "The ZenLink Studio driver is installed, but Windows hasn't attached it to the device yet. Unplug the cable and plug it in again (restart Windows if that doesn't help)."
msgstr "Driver ZenLink Studio sudah terpasang, tapi Windows belum memakainya untuk perangkat ini. Cabut lalu colok lagi kabelnya (restart Windows kalau belum berhasil)."

#. added by hand
msgid "The USB Direct driver isn't installed for this device yet. Open Settings > Connection & Drivers and press Install USB Direct driver, then reconnect the cable."
msgstr "Driver ZenLink Studio belum terpasang di perangkat ini. Buka Pengaturan > Koneksi & driver, tekan Pasang driver ZenLink Studio, lalu colok ulang kabelnya."

#. added by hand
msgid "Another driver change is running."
msgstr "Penggantian driver lain sedang berjalan."

#. added by hand
msgid "The device isn't on Wi-Fi yet. Press Set up Wi-Fi in Settings with the cable connected, keep both on the same network, or switch to Wired."
msgstr "Perangkat belum tersambung Wi-Fi. Tekan Atur Wi-Fi saat kabel tersambung, pastikan di jaringan yang sama, atau pilih Kabel."

